cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software itself and the associated manuscript below."
type: software
title: "MHD Micropolar Soret-Dufour BVP: Python solver and independent cross-check"
abstract: >-
  Python/SciPy reproducibility code for the manuscript "Nonlinear Coupled
  Heat and Mass Transfer in MHD Micropolar Fluid Flow past a Vertical
  Plate with Thermal Dispersion, Soret-Dufour Effects and Chemical
  Reaction", submitted to the Chinese Journal of Physics. Includes the
  primary collocation solver, an independently coded shooting cross-check,
  the entropy-generation and Bejan-number module, and the scripts
  reproducing every numerical table and figure in the manuscript.
